add(246,[51],'unpursued implication',[118,126],'963-974;1116-1121','sont des V.A.','The earlier run compares the assertion with algebraic representatives, especially universal regular quotients of CH²_alg. Such a quotient need not equal its full source group.','The universal-regular-homomorphism comparison is external; the manuscript’s whole-source claim is stronger.','agrees','The comparison is correctly bounded and does not turn representability of a quotient into a Chow-group isomorphism.')
