add(274,[83],'idea of the earlier run',list(range(87,133)),'1-1312','','The formal-period torsor theorem and injectivity of evaluation to complex periods are different statements.','The entire comparison is earlier-run context, not a recovered handwritten period conjecture.','not on the page','No period-conjecture formulation occurs in the assigned range.')
