add(276,[85],'unpursued implication',list(range(87,133)),'1-1312','','Grothendieck’s1966 de Rham paper contains a direct period expectation in note10, contrary to an earlier project description that knew such expectations only through reports.','A bibliographical correction outside the selected range, not an emendation to it.','not on the page','The selected pages contain no period-conjecture statement.')
