add(278,[87],'other',[89,92,94,95,96,98,100,103,106,107,108,109,111,112,113,114,115,116,117,121,122,126,127,128],'88-1224','Question; Je présume; Pb; à prouver','The entry consists of a bounded negative arithmetic-transfer paragraph followed by the full51-row standing register of manuscript questions, cancellations and conditional OK labels. Each substantive register assertion is assigned to the corresponding detailed items200–277 and claims/problems.','The register is an index, not an additional proof or51 new independent source entries. Its LM7/FLAGGED project claims remain unverified leads.','agrees','Every register row was read against its already-read passage; corrections concerning supplied continuations and notation are inherited from detailed items.')
